<title>POLAND: JUTRZENKA NEW ISSUE FULLY UNDERWRITTEN.</title>
<headline>JUTRZENKA NEW ISSUE FULLY UNDERWRITTEN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wood Securities BV and Polish</p>
<p>Bank Handlowy SA brokerage underwrote a one-million share new</p>
<p>issue of Polish confectioner Jutrzenka SA, Jutrzenka said in a</p>
<p>statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The company also said it has resubmitted its issue</p>
<p>prospectus to the Polish Securities Commission (KPW) after the</p>
<p>KPW demanded some amendments in the prospectus.</p>
<p>UNDERWRITER:			   NO OF SHARES	STAND-BY FEE</p>
<p>					   UNDERWRITTEN</p>
<p>Wood Securities BV		    750,000	     5 pct*</p>
<p>Bank Handlowy brokerage	     250,000	     5 pct</p>
<p>NOTE: Jutrzenka said that if the main market all-share WIG</p>
<p>index was below 13,200 points 10 days before the subscription</p>
<p>starts, underwriters would pay 55 zlotys per share and 67</p>
<p>zlotys if it was equal or higher than that level.</p>
<p>Wood Securities will get additional one percent for</p>
<p>arranging the underwriting consortium.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
